9:["$","span","0",{"children":"The key difference from manual invoices is structure. In a manual invoice, you may edit a Word file, spreadsheet or old PDF and hope the formulas and layout stay correct. With an invoice generator, you fill fields and the tool builds the invoice for you."}]
